{"unit_id":"tag:094B:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为 Grothendieck 阿贝尔范畴（abelian category）。设\n<MATH_0002> 为一对象（objects）集（set），满足\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0003> 的任意对象（object）都是\n<MATH_0004> 中元素（elements）的直和（direct sum）的商（quotient），且\n<STRUCT_0003> 对任意 <MATH_0005>，函子（functor）<MATH_0006>\n与直和（direct sums）交换（commutes）。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n则 <MATH_0007> 的每个紧（compact）对象（object）都是\n<MATH_0008> 中某个有限（finite）复形（complex）的直和因子（direct summand），其各项为\n<MATH_0009> 中元素（elements）的有限（finite）直和（direct sums）。\n","allowed_english":["Grothendieck"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"abelian category","target_term":"阿贝尔范畴"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"elements","target_term":"元素"},{"source_term":"direct sum","target_term":"直和"},{"source_term":"quotient","target_term":"商"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"direct sums","target_term":"直和"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换"},{"source_term":"compact","target_term":"紧"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"direct summand","target_term":"直和因子"},{"source_term":"elements","target_term":"元素"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"direct sums","target_term":"直和"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"abelian category","target_term":"阿贝尔范畴","context":"Grothendieck 范畴"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象","context":"生成对象集"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集","context":"生成对象集"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"任意输入及紧性"},{"source_term":"elements","target_term":"元素","context":"生成对象"},{"source_term":"direct sum","target_term":"直和","context":"商的来源"},{"source_term":"quotient","target_term":"商","context":"生成性"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"与直和交换"},{"source_term":"direct sums","target_term":"直和","context